      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0010:0004",
      "source": "`workspace`: Scratch space of size `Factored.solveWorkspaceRequiredStatic + nrhs * Factored.solveWorkspaceRequiredPerRHS`. This memory must be 16-byte aligned (any allocation returned by `malloc()` has this property).",
